# 🛡️ IAM Users & Groups - AWS IAM Assignment (Module 3)

## 📌 Problem Statement

You work for **XYZ Corporation**. To maintain the security of the AWS account and the resources, you have been asked to implement a solution that can help easily recognize and monitor different users.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Create IAM users and groups
- Assign users to appropriate groups based on roles
- Practice AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)

